  dialogue:
  - Welcome to my temple.
  - 'It appears you have come in peace, right?


    No?'
  - 'Ah, yes. You aren''t like everyone else: you are here to achieve greater power!'
  - 'That''s great, but in order for you to gain further power, you will come across
    obstacles you must face.


    Right now, I am going to be one of those obstacles
    for you.'
  - '*Come now, show me who you truly are.'
